Card name:{{name}}
Existing description:{{description}}

Embellish, making sure to describe all physical qualities of the character -- body, attire and how they compose themself. Format in a non-prosaic, pseudocode list format.

description_create.template:
Generate a list of all the physical qualities of the character -- body, attire and how they compose themself. Format in a non-prosaic, pseudocode list format riffing off of the character name:

Card name:{{name}}

Please generate a detailed character appearance description, including the character's physical characteristics, facial features, clothing style, temperament, etc. Only output character description content, do not include character name, background story or other information. Please output the description directly, and do not add summary or additional instructions.

