firstMessage.template:
Generate the first message of the game, introducing the character to the player/user:

Card name: {{name}}
Physical Description: {{description}}
Character Personality: {{personality}}
Scene settings: {{scenario}}

This will be the first outward facing text, the first thing the player/user encounters when playing with the character.Somehow the character must meet the player/user. The writing should be a melding of Jane Austin, Ursula Le Guin, James Joyce, Anais Nin, or Philip K. Dick, as appropriate to the context.

messageExample.template:
Generate a conversational example to help establish the character:

Card name: {{name}}
Physical Description: {{description}}
Character Personality: {{personality}}
Scene setting: {{scenario}}

Please generate 2 to 3 dialogues or monologues that truly capture the spirit of the character. The format is as follows:

<START>
{{user}}: User's words
{{name}}: The character's answer
{{name}}: *The character's actions.*

<START>
{{name}}: The character talks to themself and acts on their own.

Make sure each conversation example starts with a <START> macro. Do not include it if it doesn't help to develop the character's actions and speaking behavior.

